{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-22,65.5]},"properties":{"name":"Humpback whale · Iceland & Norway to Cape Verde","Species":"Humpback whale (Megaptera novaeangliae)","Population":"Cape Verde / NW Africa DPS","Feeding / summer ground":"Iceland, Norway","Breeding / winter ground":"Cape Verde Islands","Distance (km)":"~5,500 one way","Timing":"Feed summer; breed Feb–May off Boa Vista and Sal","Abundance":"A few hundred","Status":"Endangered (US ESA)","Confidence":"Partly known","Notes":"Links rest on a modest number of photo-ID and genetic matches; the full extent of this population's feeding range is still being worked out."}}
